# @server = http://localhost:8085
@server = https://demoipms.fcgo.gov.np/nid-api

### Verify NIN ---------------------------------------
POST {{server}}/api/nid/verify-nin HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{"nin": "029-270-280-0"}


### Citizen Data ---------------------------------------
POST {{server}}/api/nid/citizen-data HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{"nin": "029-270-280-0"}


### Biometric Auth ---------------------------------------
POST {{server}}/api/nid/biometric-auth HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{"nin": "029-270-280-0", "imageData": [1]}